  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あしを　つよく　けり　あいてを\nころばせて　こうげきする。あいてが\nおもいほど　いりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "발을 강하게 걸고\n상대를 넘어뜨려 공격한다.\n상대가 무거울수록 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用力踢對手的腳，\n讓對手摔倒進行攻擊。\n對手越重，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un puissant coup de pied bas qui fauche l’ennemi.\nIl est plus efficace contre les ennemis lourds.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Tritt, der das Ziel umwirft. Je schwerer das Ziel ist,\ndesto mehr Schaden fügt ihm die Attacke zu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Patada baja que derriba al oponente. Cuanto más pesa\nel objetivo, más daño le causa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un calcio basso e potente che fa cadere il bersaglio.\nDanneggia maggiormente i Pokémon più pesanti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A powerful low kick that makes the target fall over.\nThe heavier the target, the greater the move’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "足を　強く　けり\n相手を　転ばせて　攻撃する。\n相手が　重いほど　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用力踢对手的脚，\n使其摔倒进行攻击。\n对手越重，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
